   "s": 2,
   "q": "As a result of our continued strong volume performance and despite ongoing near term operating cost pressures, we now anticipate both revenue and profit before tax for the full year to be ahead of current market expectations.",
   "file": "20211129_BAG_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-02-01",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "Operating margin before exceptional items for the financial year is expected to be around 15.6% (2020/21: 14.8%), delivering profit before tax and exceptional items marginally ahead of our November 2021 guidance.",
   "file": "20220201_BAG_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-03-29",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
